 THE ENV. A change-LOCATION-pruned, REAL-ENV-VALUE-GROUNDED interleaved
 act-and-observe search on A1's exact held-out games. .451 proved change-VALUE
 prediction is REPRESENTATION-INVARIANT (3 classes) but change-LOCATION is
 learnable (cell_recall 0.727). A1 demotes the model from state-predictor to
 action-PRIOR: per state, the change-LOCATION model ranks WHICH legal actions
 change something meaningful, the agent EXECUTES the top-k in the REAL env
 (reset-replay) to read the TRUE next state (change-VALUE for free, never
 predicted), the learned verifier scores progress to the .437-quality goal,
 best-first. Measures BOTH north-star axes: ACCURACY (NEVER_ENUMERATED ->
 COVERED migration / first-win vs 0.04) and EFFICIENCY (actions-to-first-win).
 The decisive swing + fork that redirects .453.

